| F8k384 | 384 | flat_sample | 8,192 | 0.1912 | 0.1862-0.1946 | 0.0486 | 0.70x |
| F4k384 | 384 | flat_sample | 4,096 | 0.1924 | 0.1890-0.1958 | 0.0554 | 0.70x |
